# Agent Dashboard - Project Architecture

## Tech Stack Overview

This is an AI Agent Dashboard built with:
- **Next.js 16** (App Router, Route Handlers, React Server Components)
- **Vercel Workflow** (durable, resumable agent execution)
- **Vercel AI SDK 6** (generateText for LLM orchestration)
- **Neon Postgres** (serverless database with branching)
- **Supermemory** (graph memory for AI agents)
- **Browser-Use Cloud** (AI-powered browser automation)
- **Twilio** (outbound voice calls with OpenAI Realtime API)
- **TypeScript** (strict mode)

